WEBVTT

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.305
Every time you switch tools, your context gets left behind.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.397
Shapr keeps what matters in context packs.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.960
Switch AI tools without starting over.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.156
Next: Shapr Flow. Your work, your permission.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.447
Remember what matters. Forget the noise.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:55.749
Shapr remembers the work, so you can focus on doing it.
